      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ebca7d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-01T16:37:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>People who haven't played against the Dreamer until now get to experience what terrible beatings she can create in an instant.</p><p>The most memorable I can rememeber is when Paul Watson and I were playing against her, she was flipped and on advanced, and I think there were 4 or 5 heroes. &nbsp;We probably had over 90 HPs collectively. &nbsp;Time Cataclysm played Surprise Shopping Trip, and on her turn, she played like 9 cards and finished us off with a Violent Nightmares for like 10+ damage after we took like 80 already.</p>",
